    "Description": "Description:This course provides an in-depth understanding of how to configure key business processes in SAP ERP. In this course, the processes configured include 3 main phrases: Financial accounting (Phase 1), Procurement (Phase 2) and Fulfillment (Phase 3). Objective:This course is designed for BA students with a vision beyond becoming SAP Consultant. After this course, students will be able to analyze scenarios, identify management problems that entreprises are facing; then recommend, build specific or custom configurations to help solving problems. After graduation, students will be ready to participate in professional training courses to become an SAP consultant. Teaching Method: Theory, practical sessions, workshop are arranged alternately, helping students understand the operation of SAP modules.",
